TITLE Equilibrium simulation at 100C, pH 3 fixed with multiple minerals

SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 3
    units mol/L
    water 1

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    K-mica       0  10
    Kaolinite    0  10
    Dolomite     0  10
    Epsomite     0  10
    Fe(OH)3(a)   0  10
    Halite       0  10
    Fix_pH      -3  HCl  10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file kaolinite_sim3.sel
    -reset false
    -equilibrium_phases K-mica Kaolinite Dolomite Epsomite Fe(OH)3(a) Halite Fix_pH

END
